# Let's Play a Game, first mode: "Creatures your opponents control get -1/-1 until end of turn" (CR 611.2c). Bot2's Ornithopter
# (0/2) becomes -1/1 for the rest of turn 3 and is 0/2 again on turn 4, while Bot1's own Ornithopter stays 0/2.

[Bot1 Deck]
Ornithopter
Black Lotus
Mox Jet
Let's Play a Game
Swamp x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x25

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Let's Play a Game.Cast
Bot1.Modes(1)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Power = -1
? Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Toughness = 1
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Toughness = 2
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
? Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Power = 0
? Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Toughness = 2

